# A Testing Time (Windurst 2-2), a repeat's kills in Buburimu Peninsula. A level 99 Warrior of Windurst (GM effects keep
# it alive) with 1-1 to 2-1 completed and 2-2 current at status 2, not completed (a GM): a Bogy spawned and killed
# counts nothing. Then 2-2 completed and current again at status 2 (a GM): each of the 26 mobs the mission names is
# brought up by a GM (spawn #<id>), killed (kill #<id>) and adds one to KillCount.
